WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:13.180
Well, I think my favorite word, and I think this is something I say always, for everything and for nothing, for everything, for nothing, and because it's always thank you.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:32.680
Because I think that when you thank any person for any gesture they make, not only for you, but for the universe, for life.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:45.420
When you give that thanks, besides being grateful, you're giving encouragement and you're motivating that action to happen again.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:52.140
When you see a person sweeping the street, those people who do the public cleaning,

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.920
those people are ignored by everyone.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:01:02.500
But when you thank one of those people and you see the smile on their face,

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.920
knowing that street is clean with a lot of love.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:10.060
So I think saying thank you everywhere,

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:14.700
knowing how to say thank you in any language, is something very important,

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:17.120
my favorite word. Thank you very much.
